{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch7Jmzs96vZYjFt9CSxCL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Before I draft, a few questions. Your answers could change how the request is framed:\n\n1. **Is there a senior paralegal role open in your group right now, or would this create a new one?** If the role is new, the request has to show why the group needs it, not just why you deserve it. Does anyone currently supervise the paralegals?\n2. **Does the managing partner know about the March deadline error?** If they do, I'd mention it briefly along with the second-person check you added, since that's the kind of judgment a supervisor needs. If they don't, it's your call whether to bring it up.\n3. **Would any of the 4 lawyers you support back this request?** If so, which ones? A named lawyer who agrees to vouch for you carries a lot of weight with a managing partner.\n4. **What exactly are you asking for, and by when?** For example: a meeting to discuss it, a decision at the next review cycle, or a specific start date. Should the letter mention the $9,000 or leave pay for the conversation?\n5. **Do they already know you built the tracking sheet and that two other groups use it?** If not, I'll explain it more fully. If they do, a short reminder will be enough.\n\nIf you don't know an answer, just say so and I'll write the letter without it."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":355,"cache_read_input_tokens":9548,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":355},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"276e98bb-37dc-4309-ab97-500b97e30723","uuid":"33b96b43-5d98-41a4-9068-c44bb41f8369","timestamp":"2026-11-16T21:21:08.679Z","requ